OL,3,GNEWSACouncil using fake flowers to
OL,4,Aavoid watering them
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council says it is using fake flowers
OL,7,Fto avoid having to water them during
OL,8,Fthe drought.
OL,10,FNorth East Lincolnshire Council has
OL,11,Fplaced plastic floral displays in
OL,12,Fplanters on the A180 flyover in
OL,13,FGrimsby, citing both budget and water
OL,14,Fshortages as the reason.
OL,16,FResidents are divided on the decision,
OL,17,Fwith some saying they were "bad for the
OL,18,Fenvironment", while others said they
OL,19,Fwere "long lasting and very
OL,20,Feconomical".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
