OL,3,GNEWSACouncil using fake flowers to
OL,4,Aavoid watering them
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Bob Callison, portfolio
OL,7,Fholder for environment and energy
OL,8,Fsecurity, said it was a temporary
OL,9,Fmeasure driven in part by the "ongoing
OL,10,Fdrought and hosepipe ban".
